    41	
    42	- **The shell itself** (C01 rail, topbar, palette, Settings tabs): C35 (`acceptance_c35.py`, C35-N01..N03) and C44-N01.
    43	- **Settings' "Use the new interface" switch** (C28, C35): removed; C44-N01 asserts its absence. The core accepts `setUiVariant` and ignores it (`ui_v2_closure`).
    44	- **Runtime Security, AI Gateway, Red Team & Models as pages** (C03, C09, C10, C13, C16–C18): Administration's product cards (C39); the Go/palette entries open the product in Administration (`ui_v2_closure`, C44-N01).
    45	- **Sessions & Reports** (C11) and **Import from v1** (C23): framed by the v2 shell as before; no board of their own in P09. C44-N01 opens each.
    46	- **The Academy destination** (C04–C07): the v2 Academy chrome around the same learner pages (C42); the learner suites under `features/academy/*.test.tsx` now exercise the v2 component.
